y shine to the hair","a light liquid formula that is easy to use","nourishes and gives a soft feel","softens and nourishes the skin","suitable for عادية and جافة and دهنية skin"]}'::jsonb, 25, TRUE, 25, 4.5, 78, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, '["haircare","hair-oils","now-foods"]'::jsonb, '{"title":{"ar":"NOW Foods زيت جوز الهند السائل عضوي 100% والبشره - Luminous Derma","en":"NOW Foods Hair Oil - Luminous Derma"},"description":{"ar":"NOW Foods زيت شعر بتركيز 100%، يعمل على يغذي الشعر ويمنحه اللمعان ويتميز بمكونات تشمل زيت الأرغان وزيت جوز الهند وزيت الخروع وهو مناسب للبشرة عادية وجافة.","en":"NOW Foods Hair Oil, 100% that nourishes the hair and adds shine, with key ingredients including Argan Oil, Coconut Oil, Castor Oil, suitable for عادية and جافة skin."},"keywords":["Hair Oils","haircare"]}'::jsonb);
