لرأس"],"en":["cares for the scalp and hair","supports scalp health"]}'::jsonb, 10, TRUE, 10, 0, 0, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, '["hair-treatments","هوب لابس"]'::jsonb, '{"title":{"ar":"هوب لابس بخاخ انرجايزر لتحفيز نمو بصيلات 237 مل - Luminous Derma","en":"Hobe Labs 237 مل - Luminous Derma"},"description":{"ar":"Hobe Labs hair-treatments بحجم 237 مل، يعمل على يعتني بفروة الرأس والشعر.","en":"Hobe Labs hair-treatments (237 مل) that cares for the scalp and hair."},"keywords":["luminous","hair-treatments","هوب لابس"]}'::jsonb);
