an, refreshed feeling to the skin"]}'::jsonb, 10, TRUE, 10, 0, 0, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, '["cleansers","افين"]'::jsonb, '{"title":{"ar":"افين غسول 400 مل - Luminous Derma","en":"Avene Cleanser 400 مل - Luminous Derma"},"description":{"ar":"Avene منظف بحجم 400 مل، يعمل على ينظف البشرة ويزيل الشوائب بلطف.","en":"Avene Cleanser (400 مل) that cleanses the skin and removes impurities gently."},"keywords":["luminous","cleansers","افين"]}'::jsonb);
