es a clean, refreshed feeling to the skin","used in both morning and evening care"]}'::jsonb, 10, TRUE, 10, 0, 0, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, '["toners","بايوديرما"]'::jsonb, '{"title":{"ar":"بايوديرما تونر منقي 200 مل - Luminous Derma","en":"Bioderma Toner 200 مل - Luminous Derma"},"description":{"ar":"Bioderma تونر بحجم 200 مل، يعمل على يوازن البشرة ويحضرها لخطوات العناية التالية.","en":"Bioderma Toner (200 مل) that balances and prepares the skin for the next steps."},"keywords":["luminous","toners","بايوديرما"]}'::jsonb);
