dds a healthy shine to the hair","used in an evening care routine"]}'::jsonb, 10, TRUE, 10, 0, 0, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, '["hair-oils","جيوفاني"]'::jsonb, '{"title":{"ar":"جيوفاني سيروم لتنعيم وتغذيته زيت شعر 81 مل - Luminous Derma","en":"Giovanni Hair Oil 81 مل - Luminous Derma"},"description":{"ar":"Giovanni زيت شعر بحجم 81 مل، يعمل على يغذي الشعر ويمنحه اللمعان.","en":"Giovanni Hair Oil (81 مل) that nourishes the hair and adds shine."},"keywords":["luminous","hair-oils","جيوفاني"]}'::jsonb);
