 مل - Luminous Derma","en":"Nivea 75 مل - Luminous Derma"},"description":{"ar":"Nivea hand-care بحجم 75 مل، يعمل على يعتني بيدين ناعمتين ومرطبتين.","en":"Nivea hand-care (75 مل) that keeps hands soft and moisturized."},"keywords":["luminous","hand-care","نيفيا"]}'::jsonb);
