 soft","used in an evening care routine"]}'::jsonb, 10, TRUE, 10, 0, 0, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, '["hand-care","يورياج"]'::jsonb, '{"title":{"ar":"يورياج كريم مغذي ومناسب 50 مل - Luminous Derma","en":"Uriage 50 مل - Luminous Derma"},"description":{"ar":"Uriage hand-care بحجم 50 مل، يعمل على يعتني بيدين ناعمتين ومرطبتين.","en":"Uriage hand-care (50 مل) that keeps hands soft and moisturized."},"keywords":["luminous","hand-care","يورياج"]}'::jsonb);
