:["gently cares for intimate areas","keeps intimate areas comfortable"]}'::jsonb, 10, TRUE, 10, 0, 0, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, '["women-care","سمرز ايف"]'::jsonb, '{"title":{"ar":"سمرز ايف غسول نسائي للمناطق الحميميه برائحه الزهور 266 مل - Luminous Derma","en":"Summer''s Eve 266 مل - Luminous Derma"},"description":{"ar":"Summer''s Eve women-care بحجم 266 مل، يعمل على يعتني بالمنطقة الحميمة بلطف.","en":"Summer''s Eve women-care (266 مل) that gently cares for intimate areas."},"keywords":["luminous","women-care","سمرز ايف"]}'::jsonb);
