 the skin and supports its natural barrier","helps strengthen the skin''s barrier","used in both morning and evening care"]}'::jsonb, 10, TRUE, 10, 0, 0, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, '["moisturizers","فارم ستاي"]'::jsonb, '{"title":{"ar":"فارم ستاي كريم مرطب باحمض الهيالورنيك 100 مل - Luminous Derma","en":"فارم ستاي Moisturizer 100 مل - Luminous Derma"},"description":{"ar":"فارم ستاي مرطب بحجم 100 مل، يعمل على يرطب البشرة ويدعم حاجزها الطبيعي.","en":"فارم ستاي Moisturizer (100 مل) that hydrates the skin and supports its natural barrier."},"keywords":["luminous","moisturizers","فارم ستاي"]}'::jsonb);
